    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45315" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Stellātis ăger</span></b> 
		or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">campus</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a district in Southern
			Campania</i>, <i>near Cales</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Agr.
				2, 31, 85</span></i>; <i><span class="en">1, 7, 20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Liv. 9, 44,
				5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">10, 31,
			5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">22, 13,
			6</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sil. 11,
				268</span></i>. —Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Stellātīnus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., <i>of</i> or <i>belonging to the</i> ager Stellatis: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tribus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					6, 5, 8</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Fest. p. 343</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Inscr.
					Grut. 35, 3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">484, 3</span></i>.</div>
